### Identity Verification API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4300
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ========================================
### 1. Get Verification Status (Unauthenticated - should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/verification/status

### ========================================
### 2. Login to get token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ========================================
### 3. Get Verification Status (Authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/verification/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 4. Verify Identity with Sample CCCD Data
POST {{baseUrl}}/verification/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "idNumber": "001234567890",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-15",
  "verificationMethod": "cccd_qr",
  "consentGiven": true
}

### ========================================
### 5. Get Status Again (Should show verified)
GET {{baseUrl}}/verification/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 6. Try to verify again (Should fail - already verified)
POST {{baseUrl}}/verification/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn B",
  "idNumber": "009876543210",
  "dateOfBirth": "1995-05-20",
  "verificationMethod": "cccd_qr",
  "consentGiven": true
}

### ========================================
### 7. Remove Verification (For testing)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/verification/remove
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 8. Verify with Invalid ID Number (Should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/verification/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "idNumber": "123",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-15",
  "verificationMethod": "cccd_qr",
  "consentGiven": true
}

### ========================================
### 9. Verify with OCR Method
POST {{baseUrl}}/verification/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Trần Thị B",
  "idNumber": "035199001234",
  "dateOfBirth": "1999-03-10",
  "verificationMethod": "cccd_ocr",
  "consentGiven": true
}

### ========================================
### 10. Test Complete Flow
### Step 1: Remove existing verification
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/verification/remove
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Step 2: Check status (should be unverified)
GET {{baseUrl}}/verification/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Step 3: Verify identity
POST {{baseUrl}}/verification/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Lê Văn C",
  "idNumber": "048199005678",
  "dateOfBirth": "1999-08-15",
  "verificationMethod": "cccd_qr",
  "consentGiven": true
}

###
### Step 4: Check status again (should be verified with masked ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/verification/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### Notes:
### - Replace {{token}} with actual JWT token from login
### - CCCD numbers must be 9-12 digits
### - Date format: YYYY-MM-DD
### - After verification, user can only verify once
### - Use DELETE /verification/remove to reset for testing
